WEBVTT

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.270
How long will it last, Woody?
Do you really think

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.190
Andy is gonna take you to college
or on his honeymoon?

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:27.950
Andy's growing up,
and there's nothing you can do about it.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.670
It's your choice, Woody.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:35.870
You can go back, or you can stay
with us and last forever.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:41.390
You'll be adored
by children for generations.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:00.790
Who am I to break up
the Roundup gang?

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.110
-Hey, Woody, are you in here?
-Nah. This one's empty too.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:23.070
-Woody! Woody!
-Woody!

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:24.150
Pardon me, gentlemen,

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.670
but have either of you seen
a cowboy doll with a bad arm?

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:29.110
-Why, no, I haven't.
-Hey! He was talkin' to me!

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:31.870
-No! He was talkin' to me!
-Why, you...

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.270
-(BOTH GRUNTING)
-You see, all along,

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:36.950
we thought the way into Zurg's fortress
was through the main gate,

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:42.070
but in fact the secret entrance is
to the left, hidden in the shadows.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:45.550
-To the left in the shadows. Got it.
-(AL SPEAKING JAPANESE)

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.510
-Someone's coming.
-Everyone, take cover.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.110
It was a big pile-up, but I don't want
to bore you with the details.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:53.510
Yes. Now, let me confirm
your fax number.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:54.790
-MAN: 011...
-011. Wait.

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:56.670
That's a lot of numbers. No. I got it.

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:58.550
-It's him.
-The chicken man.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:00.230
Funny, he doesn't look like poultry.

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:02.670
SLINKY: That's the kidnapper, all right.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.590
A kidnapper!
An agent of Zurg if I ever saw one.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:10.150
(GRUNTING)

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:17.470
And the pièce de résistance!

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:20.870
I promise the collection will be
the crown jewel of your museum.

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.070
-It's Woody!
-Now that I have your attention,

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:26.030
imagine we added
another zero to the price, huh?

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.270
(MAN SPEAKING, INDISTINCT)

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:30.950
-I'll pay anything you want.
-Yes! Yes!

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:33.750
You got a deal!
I'll be on the next flight to Japan!

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:35.870
Quick.
Into the poultry man's cargo unit.

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:38.350
He'll lead us to Zurg.
Move, move, move!

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:41.430
(SPUTTERING)
Don't touch my mustache!

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.830
(SCATTING HAPPILY)

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:44.910
(GRUNTS)

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:47.390
(AL SPEAKING, INDISTINCT)

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.710
Rich, rich, rich, rich!

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:50.870
(LAUGHING MANIACALLY)

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.110
-(GASPS)
-(HUMMING HAPPILY)

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:58.750
(GRUNTS)

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.310
(CONTINUES HUMMING)

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:06.670
(GROANS)

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:12.510
(GROANS)

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:36.630
Huh?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.750
(GRUNTS)

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.150
(DOORS MOOING)

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.630
(RADAR BUZZING)

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:08.750
(GROWLS) Destroy Buzz Lightyear.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:12.390
Destroy Buzz Lightyear.
Destroy Buzz Lightyear.

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:20.230
-REX: Augh! He didn't take the bag!
-No time to lose!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.150
(GRUNTING)

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:31.950
He's ascending
in the vertical transporter.

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.070
All right, everyone. Hang on.
We're gonna blast through the roof.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:39.030
-Uh, Buzz?
-To infinity and beyond!

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:45.870
What are you? Insane? We're
wasting time. Stand still, Godzilla.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.990
-(GRUNTING)
-I don't understand.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:50.910
Somehow my fuel cells have gone dry.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:55.310
-(SCREAMS)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.350
(LASER BUZZING)

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.350
(LASER STOPS)

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:11.310
-(BELL DINGS)
-Blast. He's on level 23.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.510
How are we gonna get up there?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:16.270
Maybe if we find some balloons,
we could float to the top.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.870
Are you kidding?
I say we stack ourselves up,

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.430
push the intercom
and pretend we're delivering a pizza.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:24.790
How about a ham sandwich
with fries and a hot dog?

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:25.870
What about me?

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.830
You can be the toy
that comes with the meal.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.990
Troops! Over here. (GRUNTS)

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.230
(GRUNTING)

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.550
Just like you said, lizard man.
"In the shadows to the left."

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.430
Okay. Let's move!

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:44.350
Mission log. Have infiltrated
enemy territory without detection

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:47.390
and are making our way
through the bowels of Zurg's fortress.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.630
You know, I think that Buzz aisle
went to his head.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.910
SLINKY: Oh, no. Which way do we go?

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:54.990
This way!

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.190
POTATO HEAD:
What makes you so sure?

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:59.910
-I'm Buzz Lightyear. I'm always sure.
-(MOTOR WHIRRING)

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:02.870
We've been detected. The walls!
They're closing in! Quick!

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.030
Help me prop up vegetable man,
or we're done for.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:06.790
Hey! Put me down, you moron!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:10.390
Guys, look! It's not the walls!
It's the elevator!

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:20.990
Come on. We've got no time to lose.
Everyone, grab hold!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.310
HAMM: What?
SLINKY: Huh?

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:25.830
Uh, Buzz,
why not just take the elevator?

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.350
They'll be expecting that.

